    "interpretation": "Precision changes alter the fixed-frontier errors and sometimes argmax agreement, with mixed behavior across models and metrics. R7 4B argmax agreement falls from 17/18 to 16/18 despite smaller maximum relative-L2; R9 9B maximum relative-L2 rises from R8 0.25554309162527966 to 0.27689970284160137. R8/R9 4B final TP1 and TP2 argmax both equal 198 while the CPU reference chooses 271. These interventions are diagnostic candidates, not transparent observation or an adopted fix; they cannot prove the original core is free of bugs."
  },
